  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV Prevention campaign among 3000 youth in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will support the Uganda Government efforts to reduce the spread of HIV, it will also support the Government to implement a comprehensive Behavior Change Communication (BCC) action plan, including mass media and community outreach to effect behavior change and reduce the risk of HIV infection among youth (15-24 years). The Project will be implemented in Mpigi District in central Uganda targeting 35,000 youth in all the 9 lower local governments in a period of 3 years (2022-2025)</narrative>
  </description>
